## Unresolved

Nothing blocking. Two observations for the record: (1) a woken `:end`/terminal reader's ready entry now carries `:cursor nil` instead of the old pre-poll cursor (the library returns `:cursor` only when a poll produced one) — verified harmless, as both restore functions (`semantic-restore`, `ast-walker-restore`) read only registers/`:value`, and `store-updates` merge is a no-op either way; (2) the intentional divergences (nil-handle → `unresolved` raise instead of host dispatch error; unknown reason → raise instead of waiting forever) are covered by the new test and match the plan's divergence register.
